      "source": "https://travelhungarynow.com/district-19-budapest-kispest/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Madárház, or Bird House, stands out with its pointed turrets and bird‑motif design, a hallmark of the estate’s folkloric style.",
